<view class="container"><view class="card"><view class="title">我的购物车</view><view wx:if="{{!ready}}" class="description">会员登录及接口尚未接通，暂不能下单或支付。</view><block wx:else><button bindtap="loadCart" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新购物车</button><view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}">暂无购物车数据，请刷新。</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="productId" class="description">{{item.name || item.productCode}} × {{item.quantity}} · {{item.selected ? '已选' : '未选'}} · {{item.sellable ? item.unitPrice : '不可售'}} 元<view><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.productId}}" data-kind="select" bindtap="changeCart" disabled="{{loading || pending}}">{{item.selected ? '取消勾选' : '勾选'}}</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.productId}}" data-kind="minus" bindtap="changeCart" disabled="{{loading || pending || item.quantity &lt;= 1}}">−</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.productId}}" data-kind="plus" bindtap="changeCart" disabled="{{loading || pending || item.quantity >= 999}}">＋</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.productId}}" bindtap="deleteCart" disabled="{{loading || pending}}">删除</button></view></view><view class="card"><button bindtap="loadCoupons" disabled="{{loading || pending}}">刷新我的优惠券</button><view class="description">当前接口仅提供券编号与状态；有效期、门槛和折扣以服务端预览校验为准。</view><button size="mini" data-id="" bindtap="chooseCoupon" disabled="{{loading || pending}}">不使用优惠券</button><view wx:for="{{coupons}}" wx:key="id"><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseCoupon" disabled="{{loading || pending || item.status !== 'AVAILABLE'}}">券 {{item.id}} · {{item.status}}</button></view><view>当前选择：{{selectedCoupon || '不使用优惠券'}}</view></view><button bindtap="preview" disabled="{{loading || pending}}">重新预览结算</button><view wx:if="{{quote}}">商品金额 {{quote.originalAmount}} 元，优惠 {{quote.discountAmount}} 元，应付 {{quote.payableAmount}} 元 · 结算单有效至 {{quote.expiresAt}}</view><view wx:if="{{pending}}">上次提交结果未确认，请用原请求重试；不会使用新报价替换原请求。</view><button bindtap="submit" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading || (!quote &amp;&amp; !pending)}}">{{pending ? '重试原请求' : '确认提交订单'}}</button><button bindtap="recoverPending" disabled="{{loading}}">按原请求找回订单</button><button bindtap="abandonPending" disabled="{{loading}}">终止未完成提单</button><button bindtap="resetPending" disabled="{{loading}}">仅旧版：核验后清除本机记录</button><view wx:if="{{receipt}}">订单 {{receipt.orderNo}} · {{receipt.status}} · 应付 {{receipt.payableAmount}} 元。尚未接通支付。<button bindtap="refreshLocalPayment" disabled="{{loading}}">查询本地支付记录</button><view wx:if="{{payment}}">{{payment.label}} · {{payment.payableAmount}} 元。未核验真实渠道状态，不能据此认定渠道未支付。</view><button bindtap="refreshOrder" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新订单状态</button></view></block><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view>
